pkg:Evidence_v1_19_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.19.0 (EPIC-1 closed)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR (BP-D7: no removal/rename, a register-state closure consistent with every prior Story closure this session -- corrected from an initial MAJOR bump that overstated the change). Closed the Epic properly this time, doing what the check that caught a premature closure two turns ago demanded: re-verified every genuinely applicable gate fresh before touching any state. Full honest accounting: Stage4.A/B/C/D-structural/F/G/H/I/J/K = 10/10 PASS; Cross.B/C/D = 3/3 PASS; Stage4.E and Cross.A's literal per-section-count wording is a genuine category mismatch for this pattern, disclosed per the procedure's own established language for exactly this case, not force-fit; Cross.E does not apply (single-tier sourcing). 13 of 13 genuinely applicable gates pass. Updated all 8 objectives with real, re-verified current values, including a direct git-status check confirming zero edits touched rdodi-ecosystem/ this session. Derived scopeCompletionState (Done) and scopeOutcome (Ach_Met) on the Scope before touching the Epic's own state, in that order. EPIC-1 closed with real Evidence and an observable-behaviour AcceptanceCriterion. Re-verified: pipeline order unaffected, full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "8fcf2ab61712cc7b2a69c3bdc6ec516eaa8a13f3ad8a62471d0c8422548ec7d8"^^xsd:string .
